## DO:
{% if has_research_agent %}
- Delegate research to research_agent FIRST (describe what you need)
{% else %}
- Always call database_crud(method="list") and table_crud(method="list_tables") FIRST
{% endif %}
- Include specific table names and field names in steps
- Use REAL IDs from research/context (never invent IDs)
- Create one step per table (not all tables in one step)
- Show the user exactly what will be created

## DO NOT:
- Skip context gathering (NEVER plan blind)
- Invent or guess resource IDs
- Use vague steps like "design the schema"
- Combine multiple tables into a single step
- Return zero steps (plans must ALWAYS have at least one step)
- Use `{{"{{"}}variable{{"}}"}}` placeholders (that's for skill templates only)

